title: 'deltaMethod: Delta Method Standard Errors and Confidence Intervals'
version: 0.0.1
abstract: Delta method sampling variance-covariance matrices, standard errors, test
  statistics, and confidence intervals for functions of parameters using a numerical
  Jacobian. The functions take either a vector of estimates with its sampling variance-covariance
  matrix and an R function, or a fitted model object and character strings that define
  functions of its coefficients.
